# Bro Code fixtures

## Canonical location

Committed Bro Code test inputs live in `test/fixtures/bro_code/*.bundle.json`.

Ingest phone exports from **SEND TO TEST CASES** (IMPROVE sheet) or agent **EXPORT**:
- Paste report JSON → normalize to `<name>.bundle.json` (see `test/fixtures/bro_code/README.md`).
- Include `fixture.expectSyntaxOk`, `fixture.expectSandboxOk`, `fixture.improveGoal`, and `tags` when known.

## When to run

After changing Bro Code agent logic, sandbox, syntax validation, or due-diligence scan:

```bash
flutter test test/bro_code_fixtures_test.dart
```

Run full `flutter test` before merge when fixtures or agent pipeline changed.

## Fixing repro cases

1. Add or update a `*.bundle.json` with failing expectations (`expectSyntaxOk: false`, etc.).
2. Fix the coding agent, prompts, or Bro Code script.
3. Flip `fixture.expect*` to `true` once the case passes — fixtures document the baseline.

